OL,3,GNEWSAPowerlifter wins golds despite
OL,4,Aendometriosis pain
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage powerlifter managed to win
OL,7,Fdouble golds at a world championship
OL,8,Fdespite her endometriosis flaring up to
OL,9,Fleave her in excruciating pain just
OL,10,Fbefore the competition.
OL,12,FLhamo Weston, from Redditch, also
OL,13,Flanded second on the podium with a
OL,14,Fsilver and a bronze medal, across three
OL,15,Fevents in the World Sub-Junior & Junior
OL,16,FPowerlifting Championships, in South
OL,17,FAfrica last month.
OL,19,FThe 18-year-old only took up the sport
OL,20,Fthree years ago, after being inspired
OL,21,Fby her brother to give it a go.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
